{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 44, :comments ["<b>He and Hosea son of Nun.</b> Since he was not called 'Yehoshua' except on account of 'יה — may He save you from the counsel of the spies'; and as long as any one of that generation was alive, he was called by the name 'Yehoshua'; but when that entire generation had passed away, there was no longer room for this prayer, and he reverted and called him 'Hosea.'"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :kli-yakar, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:16:06.966449158Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}